#. text part1 of popup with automatic changes continous
#: libyui-ncurses-pkg/src/NCPackageSelector.cc:1294
#: libyui-ncurses-pkg/src/NCPkgStrings.cc:575
msgid "packages have been changed to resolve dependencies:"
msgstr "ແພັກເກດໄດ້ຖືກປ່ຽນແປງເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂການຂຶ້ນຕໍ່ກັນ:"

#: libyui-ncurses-pkg/src/NCPackageSelector.cc:1317
msgid ""
"You can choose to install anyway, but you risk getting a corrupted system."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກຕິດຕັ້ງຕໍ່ໄປໄດ້, ແຕ່ທ່ານມີຄວາມສ່ຽງທີ່ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ລະບົບເສຍຫາຍ."

#: libyui-ncurses-pkg/src/NCPackageSelector.cc:1318
msgid "&Continue anyway"
msgstr "&ດຳເນີນການຕໍ່ໄປ"

